      "question_id": "gaokao_diag_chemistry_04_q03",
      "sequence": 3,
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">一、选择题：本题共13小题，每小题6分，共78分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，只有一项是符合题目要求的。(化学部分为第7~13题)</section><br>7. 一定温度下，AgCl和Ag2CrO4的沉淀溶解平衡曲线如图所示。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/846fb5636eb1a532b149.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>下列说法正确的是",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content_html": "a点条件下能生成Ag2CrO4沉淀，也能生成AgCl沉淀"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content_html": "点时，c(Cl-)=c(CrO<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/965f5aab47569cef512c.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">)，Ksp(AgCl)=Ksp(Ag2CrO4)"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content_html": "Ag2CrO4+2Cl-<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/d721f42eee5adb4f97c1.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">2AgCl+CrO<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/965f5aab47569cef512c.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的平衡常数K=107.9"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content_html": "向NaCl、Na2CrO4均为0.1mol·L-1的混合溶液中滴加AgNO3溶液，先产生Ag2CrO4沉淀"
        }
      ],
